      "text": "Saving Throw DC 18 Fortitude save\n\nOnset 1d4 days\n\n---\n\nStage 1 Enfeebled 1 (1 day)\n\nStage 2 Enfeebled 2 (1 day)\n\nStage 3 Enfeebled 3 (1 day)"
